<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Platform Settings — Super Admin</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;background:#f3f4f6;color:#111}
.top{background:#1a1a2e;color:#fff;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.top h1{font-size:18px;font-weight:700}
.top a{color:#a5b4fc;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;margin-left:16px}
.main{padding:24px;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto}
.page-header{margin-bottom:20px}
.page-header h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:700}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px}
.card h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px}
.card p{font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:16px}
.form-group{margin-bottom:14px}
label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#374151;margin-bottom:4px}
input,textarea{width:100%;padding:9px 12px;border:1px solid #d1d5db;border-radius:8px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;outline:none}
input:focus,textarea:focus{border-color:#6366f1;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(99,102,241,.1)}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:8px;border:none;font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.btn-indigo{background:#6366f1;color:#fff}
.alert{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:16px}
.alert-success{background:#d1fae5;color:#065f46}
.tip{background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#1e40af;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1.6}
.tip strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;font-size:13px}
.status-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13px}
.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;flex-shrink:0}
.dot-green{background:#1db954}.dot-red{background:#e53935}
.hint{font-size:11px;color:#6b7280;margin-top:3px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top">
  <h1>👑 Super Admin</h1>
  <div>
    <a href="/superadmin">Dashboard</a>
    <a href="/superadmin/vendors">Vendors</a>
    <a href="/superadmin/plans">Plans</a>
    <a href="/superadmin/templates">Templates</a>
    <a href="/superadmin/logout">Logout</a>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="main">
  <div class="page-header"><h2>⚙️ Platform Settings</h2></div>

  <% if(locals.query && locals.query.saved){ %>
  <div class="alert alert-success">✅ Settings saved successfully!</div>
  <% } %>

  <form method="POST" action="/superadmin/settings">

    <!-- WhatsApp Token -->
    <div class="card" style="border:2px solid #25d366">
      <h3>📱 WhatsApp Platform Token</h3>
      <p>Yeh token sab vendors ke liye use hoga jinka apna token set nahi hai. Ek baar save karo — sab new vendors automatically is token se kaam karenge.</p>

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>💡 System User Token kaise banao:</strong>
        Meta Business Manager → Settings → System Users → Add System User →
        Generate Token → Select App → Permissions: whatsapp_business_messaging, whatsapp_business_management → Generate
        <br><br>
        ⚠️ System User Token expire nahi hota — regular token 60 din mein expire hota hai
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>WABA ID (WhatsApp Business Account ID)</label>
        <input type="text" name="platform_waba_id" value="<%= wabaId %>" placeholder="123456789012345">
        <div class="hint">Meta Business Manager → WhatsApp → WhatsApp Accounts → Account ID</div>
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Platform WhatsApp Token (System User Token)</label>
        <textarea name="platform_whatsapp_token" rows="3" placeholder="EAAxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx..."
          style="font-size:11px"><%= waToken %></textarea>
        <div class="hint">Meta Business Manager → System Users → Generate Token (whatsapp_business_messaging + whatsapp_business_management permissions)</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Razorpay -->
    <div class="card">
      <h3>💳 Razorpay Payment Gateway</h3>
      <p>Subscription payments ke liye. Vendor jab plan kharidega toh payment tumhare account mein ayegi.</p>

      <div class="tip">
        <strong>💡 Keys kahan se milenge:</strong>
        <a href="https://dashboard.razorpay.com/app/keys" target="_blank" style="color:#1e40af">
          dashboard.razorpay.com → Settings → API Keys → Generate Key
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Razorpay Key ID</label>
        <input type="text" name="platform_razorpay_key_id" value="<%= rzpKeyId %>" placeholder="rzp_live_xxxxxxxxxxxx">
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>Razorpay Key Secret</label>
        <input type="password" name="platform_razorpay_key_secret" value="<%= rzpKeySecret %>" placeholder="••••••••••••••••••••••••">
        <div class="hint">Secret secure rakho — kisi ko share mat karo</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-indigo" style="width:100%;padding:12px;font-size:14px;justify-content:center">
      💾 Save All Settings
    </button>
  </form>

  <!-- Status Card -->
  <div class="card" style="background:#f9fafb;margin-top:20px">
    <h3 style="color:#374151;margin-bottom:14px">📊 Current Status</h3>
    <div class="status-row">
      <span class="dot <%= wabaId ? 'dot-green' : 'dot-red' %>"></span>
      WABA ID: <strong><%= wabaId || 'Not set ⚠️' %></strong>
    </div>
    <div class="status-row">
      <span class="dot <%= waToken ? 'dot-green' : 'dot-red' %>"></span>
      WhatsApp Token:
      <strong><%= waToken ? waToken.substring(0,15)+'...' : 'Not set ⚠️' %></strong>
    </div>
    <div class="status-row">
      <span class="dot <%= rzpKeyId ? 'dot-green' : 'dot-red' %>"></span>
      Razorpay Key ID:
      <strong><%= rzpKeyId ? rzpKeyId.substring(0,14)+'...' : 'Not set' %></strong>
    </div>
    <div class="status-row">
      <span class="dot <%= rzpKeySecret ? 'dot-green' : 'dot-red' %>"></span>
      Razorpay Secret:
      <strong><%= rzpKeySecret ? '••••••••••••' : 'Not set' %></strong>
    </div>

    <% if(!waToken){ %>
    <div style="margin-top:14px;background:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px;color:#7d4e00">
      ⚠️ WhatsApp Token set nahi hai. Vendors ke bots kaam nahi karenge jab tak token set na ho.
    </div>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
